COMPILATION OF: E51D

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51D

   1 a 0000 E51D:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] VARIABLE dividend over a COMPOUND divisor: z = a /
   4 a 0006      (b + c).  The dividend is already evidenced parked across a
   5 a 0006      variable-divisor evaluation (F005); the question is whether
   6 a 0006      the sum can be built INSIDE the parked region: H-D-inline
   7 a 0006      predicts LHLD a / PUSH H / LHLD b / XCHG / LHLD c / DAD D /
   8 a 0006      POP D / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD z.  H-D-temp predicts a
   9 a 0006      materialised divisor cell; H-D-refuse a DR boundary on
  10 a 0006      compound divisors (no binary witness exists either way today). */
  11 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  12 c 0006   z = a / (b + c);
  13 a 0019 end E51D;

CODE SIZE = 001C
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
